    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> theotherjimmy created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14772#discussion_r4444303912\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hard coding an offset here fails tests, so I don't think this is handled with regular addition. I'll add (pun intended) an isle rule for this since it's probably better in isle than rust.</p>\n</blockquote>",
