        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> uweigand submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14772#pullrequestreview-5752266814\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This now looks good except for the missing GOT support for regular calls.</p>\n</blockquote>",
