    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> uweigand created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14772#discussion_r4454726390\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We need GOT support for regular calls as well, not just tail calls and try_calls.</p>\n</blockquote>",
